rationale":"按本篇分傳、明示姓名與敘事承接限定異稱。酈寄字況據第14段；夏侯嬰的嬰限定第16至21段，灌嬰限定第22至33段，桓嬰另人。第6與20、28段楚王信和反韓王信分人；未詳名王侯不補名。同名跨篇同指另待逐項證據。"},{"id":"d-shiji098-020","person_id":"fs1_3m9_rj3","surfaces":["章平"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-098-fujin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:p006","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/098.json"}],"rationale":"依傅寬、靳歙、周緤分段敘事及明示姓名定位；楚王信與平城下韓信分存，單稱參勃哙敞不補姓，兩位信武侯分持有人，周昌不按同名跨篇合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji095-military-zhangping","person_ids":["fs1_3m9_rj3"],"canonical_person_id":"fs1_3m9_rj3","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-095-fankuang","c-shiji-054-cao","c-shiji-057-zhou","c-shiji-098-fujin","c-shiji-008-gaozu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang","source_id":"s-shiji-095-fankuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p005","mention_ids":["c-shiji-095-fankuang:m005-0035"],"quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/095.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao","source_id":"s-shiji-054-cao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p004","mention_ids":["c-shiji-054-cao:m004-0049","c-shiji-054-cao:m004-0083","c-shiji-054-cao:m004-0086","c-shiji-054-cao:m004-0130"],"quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/054.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou","source_id":"s-shiji-057-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-057-zhou:p003","mention_ids":["c-shiji-057-zhou:m003-0072"],"quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/057.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-098-fujin","source_id":"s-shiji-098-fujin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:p006","mention_ids":["c-shiji-098-fujin:m006-0008"],"quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/098.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p030","mention_ids":["c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0121"],"quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/008.json"}],"rationale":"還定三秦時好畤、景陵及隴西的章平軍連讀。〈高祖本紀〉原文明稱雍王弟章平；《索隱》稱章邯子另存參考，不將這項差異用來否定共同軍事身份，也不把古注當已採父系。 原文與錨點不改，同